{"id":"00224","root":"uni00224_1","name":{"ja":"霧原　純子","en":"Kirihara Junko"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"霧原　純子","en":"Kirihara Junko"},"element":"Science","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin","UFS"],"release":"2019-07-31","limited":false,"characterId":165,"profile":{"ja":"政府から米連へ派遣されている対魔忍。その物腰の柔らかさと、丁寧な対応から対魔忍たちの中でも信頼が篤い。特に五車学園の学生からは頼れるお姉さんとして、任務以外の相談を受けることもあるほど。米連への派遣の表向きの目的は、魔族や中華連合を相手にする際の戦力強化とされているが、実際には政治的な思惑が強く、互いに貸しを作ったり、あわよくば情報を得たりしようという目論見がある。とはいえそれを表には出さず、米連側と円滑な関係を築く為に、戦闘能力だけでなく高い折衝力を持つ彼女が適任と判断された。戦闘においても、雷遁の術使いの彼女は米連の装備と相性が良い。その上で、あくまでもチームプレイに徹して部隊の仲間の顔も立てるようにしているため、最初こそ対魔忍を警戒していた米連の兵士達も彼女を信頼するようになっている。なお、本人は政治的な思惑を理解はしているが、現場の兵士達を騙すような作戦にあまりいい気はしていない。","en":"A Taimanin dispatched from the government to the United States. Her gentle manner and courteous attitude have earned her deep trust among the Taimanin. Students at Gosha Academy even rely on her as an older sister figure, seeking her counsel on matters beyond missions. Officially, her deployment to the United States is presented as a reinforcement of forces against demons and the Sino-Union, but in reality strong political motives are at play, with both sides looking to create debts and, if possible, gather intelligence. She does not flaunt these motives; instead, her combination of combat skill and high-level negotiation makes her ideal for maintaining smooth relations with the US side. In battle, her thunder-style ninjutsu meshes well with US equipment. Moreover, she remains committed to team play, ensuring her comrades get credit, which has turned the initially wary US soldiers into believers in her. While she understands the political scheming, she is not comfortable with plans that deceive the frontline troops."},"illustrator":"旭","voiceActor":"いねむりすやこ","forms":[{"id":"uni00224_1","rarity":2,"rarityLabel":"R","levelMax":50,"stats":{"hp":[734,1468],"sp":[160,160],"atk":[133,266],"def":[87,174],"spd":[49,49],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["5","270009"]},{"